@dc:title "Waterline Construction Description Bundle"
@dc:description "A bundle that includes all descriptions in the Waterline Construction project."

description bundle <https://waterline.project/waterline-construction/description-bundle#> as d-bundle {

    uses <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/> as dc
    uses <https://waterline.project/waterline-construction/vocabulary-bundle#>

    includes <https://waterline.project/waterline-construction/waterline-description#>
}